            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Amazon AWS & Cipher strike deal, Beyond Meat delays Q3 results",
            "description": "<p>Yahoo Finance anchor <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/\">Julie Hyman</a> tracks Monday's top moving stocks and biggest market stories in this<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\"> Market Minute</a>.</p>\n<p>Cipher Mining (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CIFR\">CIFR</a>) stock is climbing after the company announced a deal with Amazon (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AMZN\">AMZN</a>) Web Services (AWS).</p>\n<p>Rare earth stocks, including MP Materials (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MP\">MP</a>), USA Rare Earth (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/USAR\">USAR</a>), and Ramaco Resources (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/METC\">METC</a>), are falling after President Trump said Chinese supply of the materials is no longer under threat.</p>\n<p>Beyond Meat (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BYND\">BYND</a>) stock is sinking as the company delays its third quarter earnings results.</p>\n<p>Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with <a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.</a></p>",
